{
  "id": "A15",
  "goal": "SDD-01-G7",
  "title": "Voice qualification evidence: the bridge's receipts, the principal's read, and the grant on the assignment and room token",
  "why": [
    "Pack 03 G7 drives a synthetic in-app voice episode from the Voice Lab. The browser sends Opus over WebRTC to LiveKit and the media bridge talks to the provider on the server, so the Lab needs product-authored receipts for the legs only the product sees (docs/plans/voice-qualification-g7.md, sophia.voice-qualification.v1).",
    "Off by default, three times over: migration 0046's grant is the migration owner's alone; the API serves none of this unless SOPHIA_VOICE_QUALIFICATION=on (off, it passes no grant on, runs no guard and needs nothing of 0046 to be ready); and the bridge records nothing unless SOPHIA_VOICE_EVIDENCE=on and its assignment names a grant (qualification, omitted otherwise). A room token names the grant only for its principal while it is active.",
    "No speech is retained: every receipt schema allows only numbers, booleans, enumerated words, ids, hex digests and times; no free text. Receipts are kept 24 hours and only the grant's principal reads them; anyone else finds nothing (not_found, 422, as the API's other reads).",
    "The guard (0046) runs on every evidence write, presence report and assignment poll, so an exchange under a grant ends at its deadline or limit whether or not the Lab is still there."
  ],
  "patch": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/VoiceQualification",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "The operator grant an exchange is under (sophia.voice-qualification.v1, migration 0046), while it is active: the bridge records receipts only then, and only while principalActorId holds the floor. Omitted for every other exchange.",
        "properties": {
          "grantId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
          },
          "runBindingSha256": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "principalActorId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
          },
          "deadline": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "maxProviderConnections": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 10
          },
          "maxTurns": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 200
          },
          "maxOutputTokensPerTurn": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 64,
            "maximum": 8192
          },
          "maxUsageTokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1000,
            "maximum": 5000000
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "grantId",
          "runBindingSha256",
          "principalActorId",
          "deadline",
          "maxProviderConnections",
          "maxTurns",
          "maxOutputTokensPerTurn",
          "maxUsageTokens"
        ]
      }
    },
